"What is the superclass of all other classes in Java?","Main","System","Object","Java","C"
"How do you convert a String named s to an integer?","(int) s","s.toInt()","Integer.parseInt(s)","s.getInteger()","C"
"What is an 'infinite loop'?","A loop that runs exactly 100 times.","A loop that never executes.","A loop that runs forever because its condition is always true.","A loop with an error.","C"
"Which keyword is used in a class to inherit from another class?","implements","inherits","extends","super","C"
"What is the main difference between an array and an ArrayList?","An array can store primitives, an ArrayList cannot.","An ArrayList is faster than an array.","An array has a fixed size, while an ArrayList can grow and shrink.","An array can hold multiple data types, an ArrayList cannot.","C"
