"If a class has multiple constructors with different parameter lists, what is this an example of?","Constructor Overriding","Inheritance","Polymorphism","Constructor Overloading","D"
"What does the finally block in a try-catch statement do?","It executes only when an exception occurs.","It executes only when no exception occurs.","It executes regardless of whether an exception is thrown or not.","It is a mandatory block for every try statement.","C"
"What is the key difference between an abstract class and an interface?","An interface can have instance variables, while an abstract class cannot.","An abstract class can have method implementations, while an interface (before Java 8) could not.","A class can implement multiple abstract classes.","An interface can be instantiated.","B"
